ious  subcultures they continue to put their  heads down and push the world forward  some people agree with that future some  people don't but the beauty is that the  free market will ultimately determine  where value is created and where value  flows  so far bitcoin has grown from zero  dollars of market cap to hundreds of  billions of dollars in about 13 years it  has permeated individuals organizations  corporations  and now we even see nation states  ultimately folks from the midwest to  wall street to silicon valley to the  southeast of asia to europe to south  america into various countries in africa  everyone in the world with an internet  connection can access bitcoin can store  economic value and can transact  without relying on a trusted third party  it's a very powerful idea and as we all  know  there's nothing that stops an idea once  it's time has come  seeing lynn talk about the various  people in the bitcoin community like  this is encouraging we should all be  optimists we're all working towards the  same vision we're all working towards  the same goal  and we're going to need everyone's help  it's a hard problem to take a long time  to solve and i'm glad that you all are  here with me and everyone else trying to  make it happen
 

